    "body": "> So currently no lock would be released which seems bogus.\r\n\r\nYikes\r\n\r\n> Since everything else is on this object is synchronous I would kinda expect it to wait for release to return?\r\n\r\nCorrect. The lock should be released synchronously, before `close()` returns\r\n\r\nI'll put up a PR to fix the algorithm soon (after #85 lands, for the sake of avoiding unnecessary merge conflicts)",
