    "body": "(Since this issue is about making `FileSystemSyncAccessHandle.close` more descriptive, I will just comment here:)\r\n\r\nThere is a wpt test [fs/FileSystemSyncAccessHandle-close.https.tentative.worker.html](https://wpt.fyi/results/fs/FileSystemSyncAccessHandle-close.https.tentative.worker.html?label=master&label=experimental&aligned) ensuring `close()` is idempotent and I think Chromium does this, but it is not in spec. It would be nice to make it clear.",
