    "updated_at": "2023-01-10T09:26:52Z",
    "body": "Releasing doesn't seem to have an exception opportunity and setting the state to closed doesn't either, so I'm not sure an early return is warranted as it wouldn't be testable. Unless releasing has some side effect I didn't spot.\r\n\r\nHaving said that, we could add a note that states it no-ops if the state is already closed for clarity. That would be okay.",
