    "updated_at": "2023-01-10T18:01:57Z",
    "body": "Just to clarify, it sounds like we prefer\r\n\r\n```\r\n- if state is closed, return\r\n- set state to closed\r\n- release lock\r\n```\r\nto \r\n```\r\n- set state to closed\r\n- if lock is held, release lock\r\n```\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
